WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,820
If you don’t understand now, you will understand later

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,620
Grow up quickly, Yoyoyo

3
00:00:05,620 --> 00:00:08,660
Okay, Yoyo, I want to have an extra bowl of rice later.

4
00:00:08,660 --> 00:00:12,620
Forget it, it’s better to grow up slowly

5
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:15,120
Brother, do you think you understand?

6
00:00:15,120 --> 00:00:17,620
Do you think everyone is as inhumane as you were when you were a child?

7
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:21,440
Eh? Did you hear that right?

8
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:23,890
Brother, do you dislike me?

9
00:00:23,890 --> 00:00:32,970
Yoyo is simply better than the online mukbang

10
00:00:32,970 --> 00:00:36,970
Indeed, Yoyo can definitely become a mukbang in the children's world

11
00:00:36,970 --> 00:00:39,970
This child looks very much like the Chinese pastoral child mentioned on the Internet.

12
00:00:39,970 --> 00:00:43,130
Strong physique, not picky about food, easy to feed

13
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:46,130
Poor old kids like Yoyo are becoming increasingly rare.

14
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:49,130
Nowadays, many children have been indoctrinated.

15
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:52,900
Why are these people praising Youyou?

16
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,900
Jiaojiao is a baby with high needs

17
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,900
Isn't it natural to pamper her?

18
00:00:56,900 --> 00:01:00,900
Children are different and cannot be generalized

19
00:01:00,900 --> 00:01:02,930
Yoyo, go play with Haoyu

20
00:01:02,930 --> 00:01:05,930
I don't want to play with her, she's too young and doesn't understand anything

21
00:01:05,930 --> 00:01:06,930
Wu Nai Tian’s Dumplings

22
00:01:06,930 --> 00:01:08,930
Yoyo likes to eat dumplings the most

23
00:01:08,930 --> 00:01:11,930
Ninini, let me tell you, be a gentleman first and then a villain before you provoke me

24
00:01:11,930 --> 00:01:13,930
I won't be polite to you anymore

25
00:01:13,930 --> 00:01:16,090
I also like Junzi hotpot

26
00:01:16,090 --> 00:01:17,090
Beef liver with green head, chicken with green onions

27
00:01:17,090 --> 00:01:19,090
I think you did it on purpose

28
00:01:19,090 --> 00:01:21,090
Just suffer death

29
00:01:21,090 --> 00:01:23,090
Death is delicious

30
00:01:23,090 --> 00:01:26,090
Yoyo likes salted egg yolk rice
